Acknowledgements (ideas only, no code taken, no source read)
  The force-directed layout follows published methods: the spring-electrical model
  (Eades 1984; Fruchterman and Reingold 1991) and Barnes-Hut approximation (1986), as
  also popularised by d3-force (Mike Bostock, ISC License).
  The seeded random generator follows mulberry32 by Tommy Ettinger (public domain).

